⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
240 calories 23g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)
Mint Chocolate Cookie Protein Ice Cream 

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Book with over 150 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40-45g Monk Fruit sweetener 
- 2.5g (½ tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- ⅛ tsp peppermint extract
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 3 Oreo Thins
240 cal 26g C, 5g F, 23g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with Mix-ins
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

